ners such as Proximie. The company is backing AI-first cloud providers like Nebius and extending its AI infrastructure with partners including Vultr, Netris and...\nLink: https://finance.yahoo.com/sectors/technology/articles/nvidia-broadens-ai-reach-quantum-161150820.html\n\n### Despite Soaring 46%, ConocoPhillips Is a Hold as Price Target Trails (source: 24/7 Wall St.)\nOur ConocoPhillips (NYSE:COP) call comes on the heels of a mixed Q1 2026 earnings report, where adjusted earnings beat but revenue missed amid softer realized prices. Below is the verdict, the math, and the scenarios that could move it. The 24/7 Wall St. Price Target for ConocoPhillips Our 24/7 Wall St. price target for ConocoPhillips ... Despite Soaring 46%, ConocoPhillips Is a Hold as Price Target Trails\nLink: https://247wallst.com/investing/2026/05/04/despite-soaring-46-conocophillips-is-a-hold-as-price-target-trails/\n\n### Is Microsoft a Buy as Cloud Revenue Continues to Soar? (source: Motley Fool)\nMicrosoft's stock has been running in place for the past two years.\nLink: https://www.fool.com/investing/2026/05/04/is-microsoft-a-buy-as-cloud-revenue-continues-to/\n\n### Gen Digital to Report Q4 Earnings: What's in Store for the Stock? (source: Zacks)\nGEN heads into Q4 results with strong growth forecasts, AI-driven product momentum and rising cybersecurity demand, but margin pressure and weak sentiment loom.\nLink: https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/gen-digital-report-q4-earnings-154500551.html\n\n### Broadcom, Google And Caterpillar Lead AI Charge On Must-See List (source: Investor's Business Daily)\nBroadcom stock teases a buy zone as fellow IBD Leaderboard members Google and Caterpillar climb out of buy range.\nLink: https://www.investors.com/research/how-to-find-the-best-stocks-to-buy/broadcom-stock-google-caterpillar-leaderboard-ai-stocks/?src=A00220&yptr=yahoo\n\n### Coinbase Has 26% Upside to Price Targets After 57% Selloff (source: 24/7 Wall St.)\nCoinbase (NASDAQ:COIN)